<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>音量玻璃 0.4.1</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>不再隐藏系统底板，而是直接把它改成圆角。所以默认状态下外观和 iOS 原样完全一致，只是方角变成圆角。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>圆角</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>圆角大小=占短边半径的百分比：100 是完全胶囊（收缩态两端半圆），60 左右是圆角矩形。下面几项都是可选的额外效果，默认全关，保持 iOS 原样。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>CornerPercent</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>100</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>100</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>圆角大小</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>额外效果（可选）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>这几项会叠在系统材质上面，默认全关。玻璃底色调到 0 时整个自绘层不画，看到的就是纯净的原生外观。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Tint</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>0.6</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>额外白色底</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Rim</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>玻璃描边</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ExtraBlur</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>额外模糊</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SlideIn</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>侧面滑入动画</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>范围</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>亮度 HUD 和音量 HUD 用的是同一套视图，默认只改音量。系统底板圆角化关掉就完全回到系统原样。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ReplaceSkin</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>系统底板圆角化</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Brightness</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>亮度 HUD 也应用</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>高级</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>如果圆角套错了层（整块屏幕都圆了，或者根本没变化），先调「向上层数」再试。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>LevelUp</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>4</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>向上层数</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ClassOverride</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>指定类名</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>留空则自动判断</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.shiyi.volumeglass-changed</string>
		</dict>


		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>套用预设（原生外观 + 全胶囊）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>applyPreset26:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>恢复默认设置</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>resetDefaults:</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
